OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest following woman's
OL,4,Asudden death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder, following the "sudden death" of
OL,8,Fa woman in Newcastle-under-Lyme.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Clayton Lane on
OL,11,FMonday at 11:15 BST where ambulance
OL,12,Fstaff were already in attendance.
OL,14,FThe woman was confirmed dead at the
OL,15,Fscene and her next of kin have been
OL,16,Finformed, said Staffordshire Police.
OL,18,FA 47-year-old man, from Stoke-on-Trent,
OL,19,Fremains in police custody.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
